= The Glorious Dead

The acclaimed play *The Glorious Dead*, adapted from Edric Renmark's Commonwealth novel, follows ordinary soldiers through the Great Wars and their slow disillusionment with patriotism and glory—and turns, in its final act, into an open indictment of the old Emperor who marched Athar into the slaughter. 

As an anti-war play, it is the target of major protest by <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> actors, especially the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>. They are calling for the government to ban the play. If we do not ban it, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> threatens to violently stop the play from being shown or watched.

Since we lack control over the Heartland state government, the decision to allow or ban the play will ultimately rest with the propertied parties.

- @ban: We await their decision...
- @allow: We await their decision...
- @allow_protect: We await their decision...

@ban
view-if: unionist_ideology == "Right" and not (marcher_toleration_heartland and heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.65)
on-arrival: guild_royalist += 4; burgher_royalist += 3; commons_royalist += 2; disfavored_royalist += 2; loyalist_strength += 50; nationalism += 5; pro_republic -= 4

The [? if in_right_coalition_heartland: right-wing coalition?][? if in_center_right_coalition_heartland: center-right coalition?] has yielded to the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>' demands, banning the controversial play. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> are quick to proclaim the decision as a significant triumph, leading to a notable boost in their morale and political confidence.


@allow
view-if: unionist_ideology == "Left" and not (marcher_toleration_heartland and heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.65)
on-arrival: nationalism += 3; guild_royalist += 4; burgher_royalist += 3; commons_royalist += 1; loyalist_strength += 15; pro_republic -= 3; strife += 1

The propertied parties have permitted the play to be shown despite threats from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span> <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. However, performances are marred by violence. Showings of the play are eventually halted, allowing the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> to declare the outcome a victory for their movement.


@allow_protect
view-if: marcher_toleration_heartland and heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.65
on-arrival: nationalism -= 3; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); strife += 1

The propertied coalition in Heartland, who we are in a toleration agreement with, have surprisingly sent the Heartland police to prevent <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> violence. Under the protection of the police, the people are allowed to watch the play in relative peace.

